---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Terms & Conditions - MrCompress"
	description="Read the terms and conditions for using MrCompress. Understand our service usage, limitations, and user responsibilities."
>
	<section class="py-24">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-8">Terms & Conditions</h1>
			<div class="prose prose-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
				<p class="mb-6">
					Welcome to MrCompress. By accessing or using our website, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions. Please read them carefully.
				</p>

				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mt-8 mb-4">1. Use of Service</h2>
				<p class="mb-4">
					MrCompress provides a browser-based tool for image compression and conversion. The service is provided "as is" and is intended for personal and professional use. You agree not to use the service for any illegal or unauthorized purposes.
				</p>

				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mt-8 mb-4">2. Local Processing</h2>
				<p class="mb-4">
					You understand that all image processing occurs locally on your device. We do not take responsibility for the performance of your hardware or any issues arising from local browser limitations.
				</p>

				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mt-8 mb-4">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
				<p class="mb-4">
					The design, code, and content of this website are the property of MrCompress. You may not reproduce, duplicate, or exploit any portion of the service without express written permission.
				</p>

				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mt-8 mb-4">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
				<p class="mb-4">
					MrCompress shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use the service, including but not limited to loss of data or visual quality.
				</p>

				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mt-8 mb-4">5. Changes to Terms</h2>
				<p class="mb-4">
					We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Your continued use of the site following any changes constitutes your acceptance of the new terms.
				</p>

				<p class="mt-12 text-xs text-mute">
					Last updated: May 31, 2026
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
